{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233740","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233740","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1423374001:1":{"text":"欧罗娜，你不是在给他们上课吗？为什么会在这里……","source_cn":"欧罗娜，你不是在给他们上课吗？为什么会在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE961DA25BED25101","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423374002:1":{"text":"难道你这么快就放弃了？朱尔和詹米他们会很失望的！哼，我就说他们看错了人！","source_cn":"难道你这么快就放弃了？朱尔和詹米他们会很失望的！哼，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F605BF52C4559AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423374003:1":{"text":"希娜，我是专程来找你，邀请你加入我的课堂的。我的课堂上会有詹米，朱尔，莱妮……同样，也不能少了你！","source_cn":"希娜，我是专程来找你，邀请你加入我的课堂的。我的课堂上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A656769019885EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423374004:1":{"text":"我不需要跟你上课，我一个人自由自在习惯了！我一个人也能生活得很好！","source_cn":"我不需要跟你上课，我一个人自由自在习惯了！我一个人也能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA87B3BEAB4D460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423374005:1":{"text":"我尊重你的选择，我只是想对你说，我不是出于新鲜感才留在这里的。","source_cn":"我尊重你的选择，我只是想对你说，我不是出于新鲜感才留在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD1D82708C5FF37E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423374006:1":{"text":"我留在这里只有一个原因，就是想成为一名老师，因为这是我真正想做的事，所以我不会半途而废。","source_cn":"我留在这里只有一个原因，就是想成为一名老师，因为这是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3A2188DB23B10A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423374007:1":{"text":"你有自己想做的事吗？如果没有的话，你现在也在寻找它的路上吧？我只是想做一个在这段路程中，能帮助到你的人。","source_cn":"你有自己想做的事吗？如果没有的话，你现在也在寻找它的路...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85CCBC1916738121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423374008:1":{"text":"我知道，你……害怕被抛弃，你害怕把信任交给我不久后我却离开，所以你不愿意踏出开始的第一步。","source_cn":"我知道，你……害怕被抛弃，你害怕把信任交给我不久后我却...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A28AB71A9F8FF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423374009:1":{"text":"所以我觉得，我必须向你，也是向我自己作出承诺：我不会轻易放弃，我会帮助你们发现自己的天赋，成为有能力做自己想做的事的人。","source_cn":"所以我觉得，我必须向你，也是向我自己作出承诺：我不会轻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CB9F7767BED644D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1423374010:1":{"text":"希娜，你愿意相信我吗？","source_cn":"希娜，你愿意相信我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86347B760EE88C5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen